    test(review): declared C24-R2-02 disposition - the Cutter's area tolerance becomes the oracle's snapping envelope
    
    Per the C24-R2-02 ruling's second paragraph, after the permanent regression
    c24_cutter_snapping.rs showed the change is the snapping of the cut's junctions
    (oracle snapped areas equal the product's to the bit). The one tolerance changes in
    c24_r1_topology.rs and in the reviewer's reproduction of the same assertion
    (c24_r2_topology.rs edit38 test); subject to round-3 confirmation, reverted otherwise.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

